经有数家车企率先熄灯......这与四个月前的北京车展形成了明显的对比。虽然监管在明确收紧，但产品端还没有完成切换。尤其是近期刚上市、刚发布的新车，小蓝灯仍然保留点亮状态......成都车展期间，几乎每一家展台的工作人员都会被问到小蓝灯接下来是否可用。来自不同车企的工作人员都表达了类似观点：如果后续监管正式明确，很多车型可以通过OTA关闭小蓝灯......行业其实已经默认，“小蓝灯被禁”只是时间问题。', 'declares': [{'type': 'self_declare', 'text': '作者声明：个人观点，仅供参考', 'self_declare_id': 2}]}, {'id': '20260825V0BNNN00', 'articletype': '4', 'title': '颠覆行业的6款电车，非常适合老百姓', 'pic_style': 4, 'publish_time': '2026-08-25 19:47:06', 'pic_info': {'big_img': ['https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OMsIwtUf9LbTuuHrNvUW1VMqLEjU-yfEX1uQyxk2mO9NYAA_870492/0'], 'small_img': ['https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OMsIwtUf9LbTuuHrNvUW1VMqLEjU-yfEX1uQyxk2mO9NYAA_294195/0'], 'three_img': ['https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OX9ip_y2AmGS4i2YmX8myPtTM8_67-eNc9pbRYsfwMJt0AA_150120/0'], 'ls_img_exp_type': '1', 'ext': {'640x360': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OMsIwtUf9LbTuuHrNvUW1VMqLEjU-yfEX1uQyxk2mO9NYAA_640360/0', '196x130': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OMsIwtUf9LbTuuHrNvUW1VMqLEjU-yfEX1uQyxk2mO9NYAA_196130/0', '330x330': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OMsIwtUf9LbTuuHrNvUW1VMqLEjU-yfEX1uQyxk2mO9NYAA_330330/0', '480x640': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OMsIwtUf9LbTuuHrNvUW1VMqLEjU-yfEX1uQyxk2mO9NYAA_480640/0'}, 'share_img': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/news_ls/Ot7vChHLxMpaz5mTe5-KqXjWFvAfJmoA7q-JhqSrJDTWsAA_240240/0', 'aspect': '0.56', 'pic_first': 'https://puui.qpic.cn/vpic_cover/f12849nb7bi/f12849nb7bi_first.jpg/720'}, 'link_info': {'share_url': 'https://view.inews.qq.com/a/20260825V0BNNN00', 'url': 'https://new.qq.com/rain/a/20260825V0BNNN00', 'short_url': 'https://view.inews.qq.com/a/20260825V0BNNN00', 'org_url': 'https://view.inews.qq.com/a/20260825V0BNNN00'}, 'media_info': {'chl_id': '24137498', 'chl_name': '尹哥普及新能源', 'icon': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/news_ls/OoWbH7qZHnNEO7R0TlCXHbyjADvL95qOYw_ntbqZTDdyEAA_200200/0', 'sicon': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/news_ls/OoWbH7qZHnNEO7R0TlCXHbyjADvL95qOYw_ntbqZTDdyEAA_200200/0', 'mrk': '角度:辩证看待每一台国产新能源汽车优缺点!\n新能源汽车电池“砖家”|世界 500强车企合作!\n新能源产业分析师【实拆5000+新能源汽车】!', 'last_ar